# The raw sink, in both the shape it had and the shape it has. Full payloads are
# 288 KB a match and never belong in the repository — the sink is off by default
# and these entries stay whatever it is set to. `data/matches.json` is the legacy
# 1 GB store, read once to seed the Standard store and then deleted by hand.
